# Context

## Why this way
The placeholder bodies are Polygon2D nodes whose .color is the sleep or
wake state, and many tests assert on that color. PersonFigure and
PitchHallArt poll the parent color each frame and only draw, so no game
logic changed. The body fill hides through self_modulate alpha 0, which
does not affect children.

## Gotchas
- PersonFigure.celebrate is called only in live wake paths. Do not call
  it from load_state, or a reload replays the burst and camera kick.
- Placeholder Polygon2D children of a dressed body (Vest, Apron) are
  hidden by dress(). Nothing referenced them.
